# Angular 22.1.6 still boots its prerender/SSR workers through node:module `register()`, which Node 26
# deprecated as DEP0205. It is one line in @angular/build, not ours, and no released version avoids it.
# The workers get a fixed execArgv, so the flag only reaches them through the environment.
# Remove this once @angular/build moves to `registerHooks()`.
node-options=--disable-warning=DEP0205